# USO Portal Frontend — environment template
#
# All backend calls use relative paths (`/api/...`) so no API base URL is needed.
# Nginx proxies `/api/*` to the Node backend in production.
# Vite proxies `/api/*` to `http://localhost:5000` in dev (see vite.config.js).
#
# Add VITE_* variables here only when the frontend needs build-time config.
